ong, if anyone makes a single noise during or after everyone but the singer must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-235","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Mirror of perfect reflection","text":"%SELF% must pick the player they think they are most similar to and they must both drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-236","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Show and tell","text":"Everyone presents the most interesting thing in arms reach, The person voted to have the least interesting item drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-237","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Bombadillo","text":"Everyone speaks in third person for %TURNS%, drink each time you forget","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-238","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Prophetic wisdom","text":"%SELF% must predict which player will leave the game first if they are correct everyone else must drink if you are incorrect they must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-239","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Passage to the underworld","text":"The first person to put a coin on each eye doesn't drink, everyone else does","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-240","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Clumsy!","text":"Everyone must drink for each phone they have smashed","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-241","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Multiply by X","text":"Everyone must drink for each relationship they have been in","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-242","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Shut up and multiply","text":"%SELF% must give a player two two digit numbers to multiply in their head while you distract as much as you can, if they succeed you down your drink if not they drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-243","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Guess who","text":"%SELF% must close their eyes and the other players choose one person to make a 3+ second noise, if %SELF% guesses correctly who it was everyone else drinks if not they drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-244","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Odin's eye","text":"%SELF% must keep one eye closed for %TURNS%, If they fail they have to drink","minPlayers"