rst to fail drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-258","pack":"Base Pack","title":"It's always Lupus","text":"Anyone that has had surgery in the past 5 years drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-259","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Chromatic Segregation","text":"Colourblind players drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-260","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Banned from claires","text":"Everyone that has been caught committing a crime drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-261","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Heavy Petting","text":"Everyone that has petted an animal today drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-262","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Washiez CEO","text":"Drink if you've ever bought robux","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-263","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Big Gamba","text":"Drink if you've ever lost more than €100 on a bet","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-264","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Roll for constitution","text":"Everyone who has played D&D shares their favourite moment and drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-265","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Keep it in","text":"The next person to leave the room has to down their drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-266","pack":"Base Pack","title":"I know what you are","text":"Everyone that isnt straight has to drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-267","pack":"Base Pack","title":"xXCreeper420HunterXx","text":"Anyone who has uploaded cringy Youtube videos as a child takes a drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-268","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Freak","text":"The kinkiest player has to drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-269","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Hermit","text":"Anyone who hasn't left the house today takes a drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-270","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Gluttony","text":"Everyone who has had fastfood this month drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-271","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Pizza time","text":"Everyone who has had takeout this week drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-272","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Hopeless romantic","text":"Everyone who has had their heart broken has to drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-273","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Things you might not know","text":"%SELF% and %PLAYER1% have to come up with an obscure fact, The person with the least obscure facts has to drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-274","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Top shagger","text":"Everyone who has had unprotected sex, drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-275","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The Josh","text":"%SELF% must down their drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-276","pack":"Base Pack","title":"AOE","text":"For %TURNS% whenever %SELF% drinks, both %PREVIOUS_PLAYER% and %NEXT_PLAYER% must drink as well","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-277","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Initiation Ritual","text":"The last person to join tonight has to drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-278","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Caveman","text":"If you've not shaved this week, drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-279","pack":"Base Pack","title":"I see the vision","text":"Everyone who can't put on (sun)glasses within the next %TIME_LIMIT% must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-280","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Mad Hatter","text":"Everyone who can't put on a hat within the next %TIME_LIMIT% must drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-281","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Swapped","text":"%SELF% and %PLAYER1% drink for the other one for %TURNS%","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-282","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Count me out","text":"%SELF% must silently count to 20 in their head. Another player times them. They must drink for every second they are off","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-283","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Rock, Paper, Scissors, Drink!","text":"%SELF% and %PLAYER1% play 3 rounds of rock-paper-scissors, the loser drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-284","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Simon says","text":"%SELF% leads a game of Simon says, first to fail drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-285","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Brotherly love","text":"Anyone that is related to another player must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-286","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The friendzone","text":"Anyone that has had a crush on a player must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-287","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The debt collector","text":"Anyone that owes money to another player must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-288","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The zoo","text":"Everyone drinks for every pet they have","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-289","pack":"Base Pack","title":"New phone, who dis?","text":"%SELF% can send a message on %PLAYER1%'s phone to anyone they want, if %PLAYER1% refuses they must down their drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-290","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The Mimic","text":"%SELF% picks a player. They must mimic %SELF%'s movements for %TURNS%. If they fail, they drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-291","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Jinx","text":"%SELF% cannot speak until someone says their name. If they speak early, they drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-292","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The Chosen One","text":"Everyone except %SELF% drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-293","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Gemini","text":"The next card plays twice.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-294","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Chain Reaction","text":"%SELF% chooses a player. They must choose another player to drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-295","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Universal Translator","text":"For %TURNS%, any question directed at any player must be answered by %SELF%. Anyone else who answers drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-296","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Mockingbirds","text":"Everyone must repeat the last word of everything %SELF% says for %TURNS%. Anyone who forgets drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-297","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Sword of Damocles","text":"In %TURNS%, %SELF% downs their drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-298","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Sacrificial Lamb","text":"%SELF% may use this card later to drink in someone else’s place.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-299","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Passing the Buck","text":"If %SELF% is asked a question they can use this card to make a player of their choice answer instead","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-300","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Circle of Silencing","text":"All ongoing card effects end immediately. All saved cards are discarded.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-301","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The Sycophant","text":"%SELF% chooses a player. For the next %TURNS% they must enthusiastically agree with everything %SELF% says. If they fail, they drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-302","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Minority Report","text":"%SELF% asks a yes/no question. Anyone in the minority drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-303","pack":"Base Pack","title":"House of Cards","text":"The next time anyone leaves the room, everyone drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-304","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Share the Load","text":"The next time someone is told to down their drink, everyone instead takes a drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-305","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Rewind","text":"Repeat the effect of the previous card.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-306","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Double Tap","text":"The next time anyone makes someone drink, they drink twice.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-307","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Equal and Opposite","text":"The next time someone makes %SELF% drink, they drink as well.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-308","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Pop Quiz","text":"%SELF% names the last three cards played. Drink once for each forgotten card.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-309","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Auction!","text":"Players bid in drinks. Highest bidder drinks their bid and may force someone else to down their drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-310","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Clairvoyance","text":"%SELF% predicts one player who will drink next turn. If correct, they drink twice. If wrong, %SELF% drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-311","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Roll of the Dice","text":"%SELF% chooses: drink once now, or double any drinks you receive next turn.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-312","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Least Favourite","text":"Everyone thinks of one word to describe %SELF%. They choose their least favourite; that player drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-313","pack":"Base Pack","title":"From each According to their Ability...","text":"Drink if you feel able.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-314","pack":"Base Pack","title":"...to each According to their Needs","text":"Drink water if you need it.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-315","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Scapegoat","text":"%SELF% chooses a player, for the next %TURNS% anytime anyone is told to drink they drink instead","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-316","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Messenger God","text":"For the next %TURNS%, %PLAYER1% and %PLAYER2% can only communicate with each other by talking to %SELF%. If they address each other directly they drink.","minPlayers":3},{"id":"card-317","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Laughing Matter","text":"The next person to laugh must drink and so must the players on each side of them","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-318","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Gambler's folly","text":"%SELF% flips a coin, everyone predicts the outcome - drink if you are incorrect.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-319","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Invincible","text":"%SELF% cannot be targeted by any card for %TURNS%, any player who targets them must drink.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-320","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Curse of the Narrator","text":"For the next %TURNS%, %SELF% must narrate any action they make, they drink if they forget","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-321","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The Silent Tribunal","text":"All players must communicate a vote to %SELF% for a player to drink without revealing the vote to the other players. The player with the most votes drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-322","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Supreme Executive Power","text":"For the next %TURNS%, %SELF% decides the target for all cards that asks a player to choose a target","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-323","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Smooth Operator","text":"%SELF% privately tells %PLAYER1% a word. They must use it naturally in conversation in the next %TURNS%. After %TURNS% if anyone can guess the word %PLAYER1% drinks, if not %SELF% drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-324","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Split Timelines","text":"%SELF% chooses a timeline. In timeline A the next card applies only to them, in timeline B it applies to everyone BUT them.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-325","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The Puppet Master","text":"%SELF% chooses a player, for the next %TURNS% they must make all %SELF%'s decisions for them.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-326","pack":"Base Pack","title":"ME!","text":"The next time a card asks %SELF% to choose a player they must choose themselves.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-327","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The Draft","text":"Any player eligible for a wartime draft drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-328","pack":"Base Pack","title":"Mutation","text":"%SELF% can change either the target or duration of any active effect card.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-329","pack":"Base Pack","title":"The Riddler","text":"All players may only speak in questions for the next %TURNS%, drink for each non-question","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-330","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Fool","text":"%SELF% tells a joke, if nobody laughs they must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-331","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Tower","text":"The shortest person takes 1 drink, the 2nd shortest takes 2 drinks and so on","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-332","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Death","text":"%SELF% , down your drink and take a shot","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-333","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Chariot","text":"Anyone who owns a car must take a drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-334","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Justice","text":"%SELF% has been sentenced to take a drink and must make their case to the jury, if they are found guilty they must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-335","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Strength","text":"Drink for each person you think you could beat in an arm wrestle","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-336","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The World","text":"Everyone drinks for how many countries they have been to","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-337","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Lovers","text":"%PREVIOUS_PLAYER% and %NEXT_PLAYER% drink together for %TURNS%","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-338","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Emperor","text":"%SELF% has been declared the Emperor, they may make 3 people drink per turn for %TURNS%","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-339","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Empress","text":"%SELF% has been declared the Empress, they may give each player a command","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-340","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Magician","text":"%SELF% , you are a magician. Make your drink disappear","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-341","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The High Priestess","text":"Everyone who has been baptised take a drink, Amen","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-342","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Hierophant","text":"%SELF% imparts some wisdom unto the group then takes a drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-343","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Hermit","text":"Anyone who hasn't left the house today takes a drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-344","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Wheel of Fortune","text":"SPIN THE WHEEL OF FORTUNE","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-345","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Hanged Man","text":"Everyone plays a game of Hangman against %SELF% , if they win %SELF% drinks but if they lose they all drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-346","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Temperance","text":"%SELF% has found the ability to excercise moderation, they can skip one drink when they choose","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-347","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Devil","text":"%SELF% can force another player to do one of their cards","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-348","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Star","text":"Everyone hold their phone torch up, last person takes a drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-349","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Moon","text":"The person with the biggest ass drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-350","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"The Sun","text":"Everyone who has been outside today takes a drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-351","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Judgment","text":"Everyone goes in turns insulting %SELF%","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-352","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Pluto","text":"The smallest player drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-353","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Mercury","text":"Everyone votes whose drink is worst, they drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-354","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Uranus","text":"Everyone with blue eyes has to drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-355","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Venus","text":"All women drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-356","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Mars","text":"All men drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-357","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Saturn","text":"Everyone wearing rings must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-358","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Jupiter","text":"The tallest player drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-359","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Earth","text":"%SELF%, drink if you've touched grass today","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-360","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Ceres","text":"Anyone that has had cereal this week drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-361","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Eris","text":"Everyone who has been in a fight must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-362","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Neptune","text":"%SELF% takes a break and has to drink some water","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-363","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Sol","text":"Everyone votes on who the hottest player is, they must down their drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-364","pack":"Occult Pack","title":"Luna","text":"The person with the worst sleep schedule drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-365","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"Hug it out","text":"%SELF% can hug any player","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-366","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"Spin the bottle","text":"Spin a bottle and whoever it points to must drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-367","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"Dancing queen","text":"Everyone has to dance, %SELF% decides who has the best moves, everyone else drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-368","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"Fashion exchange","text":"%SELF% swaps a piece of clothing with %PLAYER1%","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-369","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"Roundabout","text":"Everyone goes clockwise taking a sip of their neighbour's drink","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-370","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"King's chalice","text":"Everyone pours a little of their drink into the King's chalice, then %SELF% must drink the chalice","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-371","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"😳","text":"%SELF% and %NEXT_PLAYER% must hold hands for the next %TURNS% turns","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-372","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"Survival of the fittest","text":"%SELF% and %PLAYER1% have an arm wrestling match, the loser drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-373","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"☎️","text":"Starting with %SELF% go clockwise whispering a word to the next player, if the word is not passed back around correctly, the player who made the mistake drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-374","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"👁️👁️","text":"%SELF% and %PLAYER1% hold a staring contest, the loser drinks","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-375","pack":"IRL Pack","title":"Charades","text":"%SELF% acts out a randomly chosen word or phrase (no speaking). The group has 30 seconds to guess it. If they fail, everyone drinks.","minPlayers":2},{"id":"card-376","pac